### Audit commands (src/moteur/commandes/nmap.ts and lynis.ts): nmap and
### lynis answer in English, like the real tools; only the game's own
### messages are here.

nmap-aucune-cible = WARNING: No targets were specified, so 0 hosts scanned.
lynis-sans-root = Lynis needs root to read the whole configuration (try: sudo lynis audit system).
lynis-usage = Usage: lynis audit system  (see man lynis)
lynis-audit-cible = Lynis here can only audit "audit system" (received: "audit { $cible }").
lynis-commande-inconnue = lynis: "{ $commande }" is not a command this game knows (see man lynis).
